---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AffiliateButton from '../components/AffiliateButton.astro';

const title = 'Best Live Cam Sites in 2026: Compare the Main Platform Models';
const description = 'Compare leading live cam platform models and see StripUnion’s current affiliate partner option for users who want public-room discovery with optional paid interaction.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} pageType="Article">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell narrow">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/live-cams">Live Cams</a><span>/</span><span>Best Live Cam Sites</span></nav>
      <span class="kicker">Commercial-intent guide · September 2026</span>
      <h1>Best Live Cam Sites in 2026</h1>
      <p class="lead">There is no single best platform for every user. The useful comparison is between public-room discovery, premium/private interaction, token or credit models, and how much control you want over spending.</p>
      <div class="disclosure"><strong>Affiliate disclosure:</strong> Stripchat is StripUnion’s current commercial partner. Other brands are discussed editorially, but we do not send users to non-affiliate third-party destinations.</div>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <AffiliateButton source="best_live_cam_sites_hero" />
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/stripchat">Read Stripchat review</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section shell narrow">
    <div class="take-box">
      <span class="kicker">Fast decision</span>
      <p>If you want broad public-room discovery with optional token-based interaction, Stripchat is the monetized option available on StripUnion today. If you want to research other platform styles first, keep reading the internal comparisons below.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="money-grid">
      <article class="money-card">
        <span class="partner-badge">Current partner</span>
        <h3>Stripchat</h3>
        <p>Best fit for users who want public live-room browsing first and optional token spending later.</p>
        <AffiliateButton source="best_live_cam_sites_stripchat_card" />
      </article>
      <article class="money-card">
        <span class="kicker">Editorial comparison</span>
        <h3>Chaturbate</h3>
        <p>Another public-room-first model. StripUnion keeps the research on-site rather than sending traffic to a non-affiliate destination.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/stripchat-vs-chaturbate">Compare with Stripchat →</a>
      </article>
      <article class="money-card">
        <span class="kicker">Editorial comparison</span>
        <h3>LiveJasmin</h3>
        <p>A more premium/private-interaction-oriented model for users comparing different live-cam experiences.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/livejasmin">Read internal review →</a>
      </article>
    </div>

    <section class="article-body">
      <section>
        <h2>Choose by spending model, not by brand familiarity</h2>
        <p>Public-room platforms make it easier to explore before paying, while premium-oriented platforms can put paid interaction closer to the center of the experience. If your priority is controlling spend, understand the token or credit model before entering private sessions.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Our current monetizable route</h2>
        <p>StripUnion currently has one approved commercial live-cam destination: Stripchat. That means our editorial pages can compare multiple brands, but the only third-party outbound conversion path we actively promote is the approved Stripchat affiliate link.</p>
      </section>
    </section>

    <section class="conversion-strip">
      <div>
        <span class="kicker">Current partner</span>
        <h2>Ready to browse live rooms?</h2>
        <p>If Stripchat matches the public-room and token-based model you want, continue through the tracked partner link.</p>
      </div>
      <AffiliateButton source="best_live_cam_sites_bottom" />
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
